                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                        "entry_id": "22e4d30f-fa26-3371-a81d-7f6ecd8044c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A car of the Honda brand."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0aa95084-0214-4d8a-a960-57fc1e045ef0",
                                "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                "text": "Jammed onto a narrow, steep sidewalk, police barricades all around, we march with placards, drums, and angry spirit: \"The Moral Majority, cops and Klan. Work together hand in hand.\" — helmeted tac squad on horses, Hondas, facing us on Powell Street, itching to wield their billy clubs, waiting for any excuse to let fly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c8c3ae8-fce5-49ca-adc5-9159e4ab2ace",
                                "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                "text": "Hondas sound like cars designed by pacifists and humanitarian diplomats. The Accord, Civic, Insight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09dfb208-9ad0-46f6-a3ec-2283584d3862",
                                "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                "text": "It’s a little disconcerting to ponder how much of my happy online childhood was spent hanging out virtually with people who were old enough to own Hondas and go on PornHub^([sic]) on purpose (and definitely people old enough to be active on Reddit), but I loved being a Jammer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "184295ee-7fcb-37c8-bb4a-a7c9cf8cc8bb",
                        "entry_id": "22e4d30f-fa26-3371-a81d-7f6ecd8044c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A motorbike manufactured by Honda."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
